  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reconstruction of 4R40 Dashtabad - Zaamin - Bakhmal - Gallyaaral Road, 24-182 km</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project development objective is to improve the efficiency of the 4R40 road transport infrastructure and ensure the safe movement of goods and people along the project road section. Specifically, it will help cope with current traffic and meet future demands for transportation, eliminate the current road efficiency constraints, which is caused by the poor design and condition of the road. Eventually, average travel time as well as vehicle operating costs will decrease. To reach this objective, the project will reconstruct and upgrade 153 km of road. The subject road is one of the main secondary roads which complements the interventions being done along the international M39 road corridor.</narrative>
  </description>
